'''Rath''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Appoplexian (Classic)|Appoplexian]]<ref>[[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen Tennyson]]</ref><ref name="CoR">''[[Con of Rath]]''</ref> from the planet [[Appoplexia (Classic)|Appoplexia]].{{Refn|[[:File:Appoplexia Proof.png]]|group = DM}}

==Appearance==
===Ben as Rath===
Rath resembles an orange and white bipedal [[Wikipedia:Tiger|tiger]] with one black claw coming out of each wrist and no tail. He is also muscular and has green eyes and black stripes on his shoulders, head, legs, and upper body as well as a white jaw, neck, chest, stomach, hands, and feet. The [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]]/[[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] is located in the center of his chest. Both Gwen and Azmuth take these appearance cues as Rath.

In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'', fur stuck out of Rath's arms, legs, chin, and head, and his muscles had protruding veins when using his strength.

In the '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' intro and ''[[It Was Them]]'', Rath looked similar to his '''Alien Force''' and '''Ultimate Alien''' appearance, but was more muscular, with longer and more pointed eyebrows. His fur appeared darker as well.

For the rest of '''Omniverse''', Rath has black eyebrows and yellowish teeth.

In ''[[The Secret of Dos Santos]]'', [[Skurd]] fixes the Omnitrix error that made Rath naked by giving him an outfit similar to that of a luchador (a Mexican masked wrestler). Rath's luchador outfit has a green and black color scheme, consisting of black boots, black gloves, and a luchador mask. Rath's claws are now greyish-silver instead of black, and the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] is now on his luchador belt.

===Albedo as Negative Rath===
In '''Alien Force''', [[Albedo|Negative]] Rath looked exactly like [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s Rath but had red eyes and a red Ultimatrix symbol. In '''Ultimate Alien''', Negative Rath lacked an Ultimatrix symbol.

In '''Omniverse''', Negative Rath looks mostly the same as Ben Prime's Rath except his fur is recolored white, his stripes and skin are recolored dark pink, and his eyes are recolored red. In concept art, Negative Rath is naked yet wears a red [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] on his chest.

In ''[[Malgax Attacks]]'', Negative Rath has clothing similar to the one Ben Prime's Rath gains in ''The Secret of Dos Santos''. However, he lacks the mask and the tank top. He wears black shorts, red gloves and boots, a red belt with the Ultimatrix symbol on it.

===Mad Ben as Mad Rath===
[[Mad Ben|Mad Ben]]'s Rath has darker fur, orange eyes, and a hairstyle like his [[Human (Classic)|human]] form. He also has Mad Ben's [[Wikipedia:Max Rockatansky|Mad Max]] style silver plates with orange spikes on his shoulders, lower arms, and calves. The [[Power Watch|Omnitrix]] symbol is on a black panel on his chest and is colored orange. He is also slightly thinner than [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]]'s Rath.

