==Personality==
===Ben as Rath===
{{Quote|Rath isn't about being impressive. Rath is about being angry, and '''Rath's angry is impressive!!'''|Rath to [[Poltroon]].<ref name="FAtC">''[[Food Around the Corner]]''</ref>}}
Rath is one of the only aliens who has a noticeable effect on [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s personality, influencing it into one resembling that of a comic book vigilante and a flashy professional wrestler.{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: The Complete Guide]]'', [[:File:Rath Anger.png|Page 40]]|group = guide|name = book}}

Rath almost always speaks in third person and a loud voice. Sometimes, when he becomes extremely angry, he mixes up metaphors (such as "a man's food is his castle"<ref name="CoR"/> or "you just bit off an eye that's bigger than your stomach can chew").<ref name="AaB">''[[Above and Beyond]]''</ref> He is aware that they do not make sense, admitting this to [[Manny Armstrong|Manny]] before they fought, but still continues to use them anyway.

Rath's muscle-over-brains mindset makes him needlessly argue with everyone around him. He even shouts at inanimate objects, like a hole he made in the ground, a stolen spaceship, gravity,<ref name="PN775IM">''[[Prisoner Number 775 is Missing]]''</ref> water,<ref name="GF">''[[Gone Fishin']]''</ref> fire, the Omnitrix<ref name="MHR"/><ref name="IWT" /> and Ultimatrix<ref>''[[Hero Time]]''</ref> for their malfunctions, the [[Proto-Tool]]'s laser pointer, a giant ball of yarn,<ref name="Catfight">''[[Catfight]]''</ref> and a paper bag on his head, arguments of which were ridiculous and that occasionally lead him to harm both himself and others. Rath's confrontational attitude often gets him and his teammates into trouble, such as when [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] tried to reach an agreement with [[Vulkanus]], the negotiation downgraded into a brawl when Rath provoked the latter by mocking his consecutive defeats by them and calling him "baby man".<ref name="CoR" />

When Rath addresses someone or something, he usually yells a sentence starting with, "Let me tell ya something" followed by the full name of the person, calling [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and Kevin by this,<ref name="CoR" /> or their position, labeling [[Khyber]] as "self-proclaimed greatest huntsman in the galaxy".<ref name="OPaP2">''[[Of Predators and Prey: Part 2]]''</ref>

Rath is very fearless to the point of recklessness, as he didn't hesitate to jump down [[Jarret]]'s throat to rescue the [[Prince of Lewoda]] or about firing the [[Vreedle Brothers]] out into space after they blasted him and his tray of food. Rath also does not make empty threats, as shown after saving the Prince and threatening to mutilate Jarret with rearrangement of his organs into a sweater if he started a war with the [[Lewodan]]s, his low snarls  hinted he meant it.<ref name="CoR" /> He also once outright admitted he had intended to hit [[Rojo]] in the head during a train robbery.<ref name="HEWTL">''[[Hit 'Em Where They Live]]''</ref> Ben even agreed with Gwen that Rath would have gone after [[JT (Classic)|JT]] and [[Cash Murray (Classic)|Cash]] upon learning they were taking credit for his heroics.<ref>''[[Reflected Glory]]''</ref>

Rath has a lot of pride in his capabilities and himself, expressing bluntness or anger instead of gratitude when Gwen and [[Rook Blonko|Rook]] saved him on several occasions.<ref name="HEWTL" /><ref name="IWT">''[[It Was Them]]''</ref><ref name="MHR" /> Similarly, he denied needing enhancements from [[Skurd]] against [[Exo-Skull]].<ref name="SoDS">''[[The Secret of Dos Santos]]''</ref>

Over time, Ben has gained slight control of himself as Rath. He once lowered his voice when talking to Gwen on the phone and showed mild irritation at her attitude before turning his attention back to the two [[Forever Knights]] at his ferocious mercy beforehand.<ref name="Duped">''[[Duped]]''</ref>

Despite the fact that Rath is supposed to know nothing but anger and fighting, he is shown to be friendly towards the Prince of Lewoda, though not at first.<ref name="CoR" />

Rath gets mad whenever someone mistakes him for a "kitty".<ref name="MHR"/>

Rath lacked the strong sense of shame his kind have, as he was always naked but had no shame.<ref name="FAtC" /> However, upon being given clothing, he did state that he "was tired of walking around naked", meaning he actually was self-conscious but didn't show it.<ref name="SoDS" />

Rath sometimes yells out his special moves while fighting. These include Polaris Piledriver, Antarian Arm Bar, Ophiuchus Face-plant, Sirius Butt-Kicking,<ref name="AaB"/> Sheer Cosmic Drop, [[Incursean (Classic)|Incursean]] Ambassador,<ref name="IWT" /> Capellan Vomit Comet, and [[Lewodan]] Elbow Drop.<ref name="FAtC"/>

Ever since Skurd fixed the error with the Omnitrix that caused Rath to go naked, Rath is capable of speaking in Spanish, though it should be noted that this is a feature granted by the Omnitrix, and is not something that Rath naturally knows.<ref name="SoDS" /> Rath was also impressed and expressed deep gratitude to Skurd for fixing the glitch in the Omnitrix that was causing him to be naked.

===Azmuth and Gwen as Rath===
[[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] and [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] exhibit the personality traits of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s Rath but speak in their usual voices. They also have different speech patterns than Ben; Azmuth refers to himself as Azmuth instead of Rath,<ref>''[[Primus (Episode)|Primus]]''</ref>  while Gwen addresses people using their full proper names instead of their nicknames and middle initials. For example, she calls Ben "Benjamin Kirby Tennyson" and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] "Kevin Ethan Levin" (and struggles to pronounce the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]]'s name).<ref>''[[Inspector 13]]''</ref>

===Albedo as Negative Rath===
Unlike Ben, [[Albedo]] has better control over his temper as Negative Rath because of his superior intellect.{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo Has Better Control of Rath.png]]|group = DJW}}

===Mad Ben as Mad Rath===
[[Mad Ben|Mad]] Rath is the same as Ben Prime's Rath but would start his catchphrase with "Oi!".{{Refn|[[:File:Mad Rath Catchphrase.png]]|group = DJW}}

===Nega Ben as Nega Rath===
[[Nega Ben|Nega]] Rath would retain Nega Ben's dour personality.{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Ben as Rath and Atomix.png]]|group = DJW}} He would also not say his usual catchphrase,{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Rath Doesn't Tell Ya Something.png]]|group = DJW}} instead saying "I don't wanna tell you anything".{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Rath Catchphrase.png]]|group = DJW}}

===Benzarro as Rath===
[[Benzarro]]'s Rath would be as backwards as Benzarro.{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Backwards.PNG]]|group = DJW}} His catchphrase is "Let me no tell you things!".{{Refn|[[:File:Rathzarro Catchphrase.png]]|group = DJW}}

