Rath possesses enhanced strength and agility, enabling him to lift objects much heavier than himself and smash through his opponents with ease. This was shown by how he was able to easily dismember the [[Forever Knights]]' paramilitary tank via brute force and toss the still extremely large pieces around (with one hand and later with two for the tank's body) with minimal to no effort.<ref name="Duped" /> Due to his incredible strength, Rath is also capable of generating shock waves.<ref name="CoR" /> 

Rath's natural strength increases whenever he gets angry,{{Refn|group = guide|name = book}} which in turn gives him an advantage in combat by powering his way through many opponents and smash through tough defenses.

Rath can perform fighting moves with expert execution, as seen when he used wrestling moves to defeat [[Manny Armstrong|Manny]]<ref name="AaB" /> and a [[Techadon Robot]],<ref>''[[Greetings From Techadon]]''</ref> battle Animo's [[Mutant Ant|mutant ants]],<ref name="IWT" /> and overwhelm [[Poltroon]].<ref name="FAtC" /> Rath either made up the moves himself or learned them from someone.{{Refn|[[:File:Rath's Wrestling Moves.png]]|group = ES}}

Rath possesses a large, retractable<ref name="CoR" /><ref>''[[Vendetta]]''</ref> black claw on each wrist, which are sharp enough to cut through the bottom of a [[Plumber Ship|plumber ship]], as well as [[Attea|Empress Attea]]'s Incursean Blaster and a box.<ref name="Catfight" /> Rath also possesses an enhanced bite force, as he was able to easily shatter [[SevenSeven]]'s blade with his sharp teeth.<ref>''[[The Big Story]]''</ref>

Rath is extremely durable, being able to take point-blank laser or energy blasts with no apparent effect,{{Refn|group = guide|name = book}} survive a free fall from several hundred feet in the air with only a bit of dizziness as a result,<ref name="PN775IM" /> break through a concrete wall without showing any pain,<ref name="MHR" /> and survive being crushed by [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]]'s hand.<ref name="IaMMMBW2">''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 2]]''</ref>

Rath can jump very high,<ref name="Catfight" /> and is very acrobatic, as demonstrated when he was forced into doing several circus tricks by the [[Circus Freaks (Classic)|Circus Freaks]].<ref name="SZTWC">''[[Something Zombozo This Way Comes]]''</ref>

Rath is very quick and agile, especially when running on all fours.<ref>''[[A Knight to Remember]]''</ref><ref name="IaMMMBW2" /> Rath can also run on walls.<ref>''[[Return to Forever]]''</ref> Rath also has enhanced hearing.<ref name="FAtC" />

Rath has some degree of space survivability, as he got onto [[Sangfroid]]'s spaceship without a spacesuit.<ref name="CoR" />

Rath is slightly resistant to heat, as he could maneuver through a burning house without much discomfort, but was still hurt by falling embers.<ref name="MHR" /> Rath is also resistant to acid, as he was able to enter [[Jarret]]'s stomach and return unharmed.<ref name="CoR" />

Rath can release a loud, powerful roar.<ref name="CoR" />

