====[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Cosmic Destruction]]====
Rath is an exclusive character for the Xbox 360 version of the game. He can be unlocked by either completing the game or by entering the cheat code "Primus".

Since he is treated as an exclusive alien to a certain console, Rath is not required to be used at all in order to complete the game.

